  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Expend one link depth on an enemy. All enemies suffer the following effect: When a hostile creature in the aura makes an attack roll or a saving throw, the target must roll a d4 and subtract the number rolled to the attack roll or saving throw. This lasts for one minute, or until your link breaks.</p><p><strong>Energize:</strong> Expend one link depth. Until Trepidation ends, roll the d4 at advantage.</p><p><a href=\"https://dnd-wiki.org/wiki/Empath_(5e_Class)\">Source: Empath by Axis, co-authored by Ghostwheel</a> (CC BY-SA 3.0). See the module's AUTOMATION.md for what is automated and how rules are interpreted.</p>",
